{{!
    @template tiny_sheetmusic/editorbody

    The body of the score dialogue.

    Everything author-facing that the shared editing surface does not own: the warning that
    scores authored here will not be engraved, the limits of MIDI import, and the empty
    element the surface is rendered into. The surface itself comes from local_sheetmusic and
    appends exactly one child to that element (RELATIONS.md section B1).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="editor" - the container handed to local_sheetmusic/editor.
    * data-region="midihelp" - see tiny_sheetmusic/midihelp.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * filteractive boolean - whether filter_sheetmusic will render scores in this context.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "filteractive": false
    }
}}
<div class="tiny_sheetmusic-body">
    {{^filteractive}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert" data-region="filterwarning">
            {{#str}}filterinactive, tiny_sheetmusic{{/str}}
        </div>
    {{/filteractive}}
    {{> tiny_sheetmusic/midihelp }}
    <div class="tiny_sheetmusic-editor" data-region="editor"></div>
</div>
